{"schema_version":"1.0.0","document_id":"4262334ecb5154d34ee03436c9c28fc861fd71b2e40f64879fd7fb347106cf1f","company_key":"yc-acunote","company_name":"Acunote","source_id":"yc-acunote-news-import-fc65b5e5f495","source_kind":"html","canonical_url":"https://www.acunote.com/blog/2011/10/all-users-except-guests-can-now-add-and-remove-task-watchers.html","observed_url":"https://www.acunote.com/blog/2011/10/all-users-except-guests-can-now-add-and-remove-task-watchers.html","title":"All Users Except Guests Can Now Add and Remove Task Watchers","summary":"","body_text":"By popular demand, all users except guests can now add and remove task watchers. The built-in User role now grants the permission to change task watchlists. If you are on Enterprise plan and already granted \"change task watchlists\" permission to users, this change does not affect you. As usual organizations on Enterprise plan can customize builtin roles and permissions. For example to revert back to previous watchlist editing permissions you can revoke \"change task watchlists\" permission from predefined User role and grant it to Admin.","published_at":"2011-10-28T00:00:00+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-07-24T14:19:11.091402+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-07-28T21:33:52.463534+00:00","last_updated_at":"2026-07-28T22:07:52.374777+00:00","content_hash":"sha256:600b68c76e36f86583cbb3240e01b984ab6a1bd552231ef55f377c1bc18bf04a","article_path":"articles/v1/6d/yc-acunote/2011/10/42/4262334ecb5154d34ee03436c9c28fc861fd71b2e40f64879fd7fb347106cf1f/article.md","record_path":"articles/v1/6d/yc-acunote/2011/10/42/4262334ecb5154d34ee03436c9c28fc861fd71b2e40f64879fd7fb347106cf1f/record.json"}
{"schema_version":"1.0.0","document_id":"515ca778918278453936a41cbf7d7a118ba3d63b045f52cd6ad4dbd375d8da79","company_key":"bridgford-foods-corporation-common-stock","company_name":"Bridgford Foods Corporation Common Stock","source_id":"bridgford-foods-corporation-common-stock-news-import-93009f6f87a2","source_kind":"html","canonical_url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2011/10/14/458664/12102/en/bridgford-foods-corporation-announces-board-retirements-and-the-election-of-two-directors.html","observed_url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2011/10/14/458664/12102/en/bridgford-foods-corporation-announces-board-retirements-and-the-election-of-two-directors.html","title":"Bridgford Foods Corporation Announces Board Retirements and the Election of Two Directors","summary":"ANAHEIM, Calif., Oct. 14, 2011 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Bridgford Foods Corporation (Nasdaq:BRID) today announced the election of Allan Bridgford Jr. ...","body_text":"ANAHEIM, Calif., Oct. 14, 2011 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Bridgford Foods Corporation (Nasdaq:BRID) today announced the election of Allan Bridgford Jr. to the Board of Directors of Bridgford Foods Corporation (the \"Company) to fill the vacancy created by the retirement of Senior Chairman Allan Bridgford from the Board of Directors. Mr. Bridgford has reached the maximum allowed service age stipulated in the Company bylaws, and will continue to work at the Company at 60% of a full time schedule. John Simmons, President of Bridgford Foods Corporation, was elected as a member of the Board of Directors to fill the vacancy created by the retirement of Director Robert Schulze. Mr. Schulze also reached the maximum allowed service age. John will continue to serve as the President of Bridgford Foods Corporation on a full time basis. The Bridgford Foods Corporation logo is available at http://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/prs/?pkgid=6840","published_at":"2011-10-14T20:41:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-07-27T00:05:26.022228+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-07-28T21:33:52.463534+00:00","last_updated_at":"2026-07-28T21:37:31.917629+00:00","content_hash":"sha256:63980a00b732e51491f624348ce050c77b60c86ebe4de74a4c282d36b6d9bb8f","article_path":"articles/v1/c7/bridgford-foods-corporation-common-stock/2011/10/51/515ca778918278453936a41cbf7d7a118ba3d63b045f52cd6ad4dbd375d8da79/article.md","record_path":"articles/v1/c7/bridgford-foods-corporation-common-stock/2011/10/51/515ca778918278453936a41cbf7d7a118ba3d63b045f52cd6ad4dbd375d8da79/record.json"}
